      "source_lines": {
        "27": "In $\\mathbf P^n\\times(\\mathbf P^n)^\\vee$, write a point as $[x_0:\\cdots:x_n]$ and a hyperplane as $[a_0:\\cdots:a_n]$. Incidence is the closed bilinear equation",
        "28": "$$\\sum_{i=0}^n a_ix_i=0.$$",
        "29": "For fixed $[a]$ its fibre is that hyperplane $\\mathbf P^{n-1}$; for fixed",
        "30": "$[x]$ its fibre is the projective space of hyperplanes through $[x]$, also",
        "31": "$\\mathbf P^{n-1}$ when $n\\ge1$. When $n=0$, the unique point of",
        "32": "$\\mathbf P^0$ lies on no hyperplane: the incidence locus and both fibres are",
        "33": "empty."
      },
